WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
What did you say, Wei Tongling?

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,440
What does Hexin have to do with this matter?

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,770
Because the great prince of Tamu tribe

4
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:16,100
I was originally going for Princess Mingyue.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,060
With His Majesty's favor for Princess Mingyue

6
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,900
and Princess Mingyue’s reputation among the people

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,340
He is the great prince of Tamu tribe

8
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,660
Become the queen of the Tamu tribe and then come to propose marriage.

9
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,340
It’s impossible for the Imperial family to agree

10
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,100
But the bad thing is Princess Mingyue

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,940
Such a bad thing has come out

12
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,420
Someone wants to use marriage to cover up the scandal

13
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:36,070
The eldest prince happened to give the steps

14
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:42,220
If the eldest prince comes to the imperial capital,

15
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,900
I'm afraid someone may have caused this

16
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,260
Then the task this time is

17
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,020
Prevent him from entering the country

18
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,680
prevent marriage

19
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,840
When is the right time to send out the mission?

20
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,680
When will the mission take place?

21
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,400
Even without the innocent Princess Mingyue

22
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,280
He is not a barbarian who can burn paper.
